1
00:00:03,460 --> 00:00:04,500
亲爱的亲爱的 快看快看
Honey, honey, look, look.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:06,000
她下巴又开始乱动了
She's doing that thing with her jaw again.

3
00:00:06,460 --> 00:00:08,780
可怜的孩子 她给自己太大压力了
Poor kid. She puts so much pressure on herself.

4
00:00:08,845 --> 00:00:10,486
这是强迫性神经失调
It's an obsessive-compulsive thing.

5
00:00:10,486 --> 00:00:13,315
我看了不下一百篇相关论文了
I have read like 100 articles about it.

6
00:00:13,390 --> 00:00:14,394
她到底是怎么得上这病的
Where does she get it from?

7
00:00:14,394 --> 00:00:16,705
这很难说
Yeah, it's -- it's a mystery.

8
00:00:16,705 --> 00:00:19,544
我知道
I know.

9
00:00:19,620 --> 00:00:20,020
艾丽克斯
Alex...

10
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:22,600
宝贝 理我一下
Honey, hi! Hi, hi, hi.

11
00:00:22,662 --> 00:00:24,000
休息一下怎么样
Why don't you take a little break?

12
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:25,360
妈 明天早上就要考试了
Mom, the test is tomorrow morning.

13
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:26,520
我一刻也不能休息
I'm not taking any breaks.

14
00:00:26,575 --> 00:00:28,160
就一小会 好吧
Just a little -- oh, okay.

15
00:00:28,160 --> 00:00:30,640
她每隔六秒下巴就动一下
She does that jaw thing every six seconds.

16
00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:33,350
就像迷你高尔夫场的河马一样
It's like the hippopotamus at the miniature-golf place.

17
00:00:33,350 --> 00:00:36,707
我的球总是被那些河马巨大的牙齿弹回来
Ohh, I've bounced so many balls off those big teeth.

18
00:00:36,707 --> 00:00:37,900
时机最重要
It's all about the timing!

19
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:38,200
卢克
Luke!

20
00:00:39,140 --> 00:00:39,980
就差一点
So close!

21
00:00:40,220 --> 00:00:42,600
-你个白痴别闹了 -卢克 回你房间去
- Stop it, you idiot! - Hey, hey, Luke, go to your room.

22
00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:43,380
快点
Go on!

23
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:44,967
她必须吃点东西
She's got to eat.

24
00:00:44,967 --> 00:00:46,544
-我出于爱她才给她吃的 -快回房去
- I did it out of love. - Go.

25
00:00:48,163 --> 00:00:50,220
瞧她拿着小口琴的样子
Look at her with the little harmonica.

26
00:00:50,220 --> 00:00:52,660
是啊 她就像个小朱尼尔·韦尔斯一样
I know. She's like a little junior Junior Wells.

27
00:00:52,660 --> 00:00:54,413
你在哪买的口琴啊
Where did you buy it for her?

28
00:00:54,540 --> 00:00:55,440
我以为是你买给她的
I thought you got it for her.

29
00:00:55,440 --> 00:00:58,200
坏了 小卡 她肯定是从刚才那家店顺手拿的
Oh, no. Cam, she must have grabbed it from that store.

30
00:00:58,380 --> 00:00:59,140
好吧 宝宝
Okay. Honey...

31
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:01,840
听好了 偷东西是不对的
listen. Stealing is wrong.

32
00:01:01,840 --> 00:01:04,320
我们必须马上回去把钱付给人家
Now, we have to go back and pay for it.

33
00:01:04,340 --> 00:01:05,600
小卡 那家店很远唉
Cam, it's so far away.

34
00:01:05,800 --> 00:01:06,920
没事 我也没真打算回去
No,I'm not going back there.

35
00:01:07,780 --> 00:01:08,020
翠西
Tracy?

36
00:01:08,660 --> 00:01:09,640
天啊 是你啊 米奇尔
Oh, my god. Mitchell.

37
00:01:09,640 --> 00:01:13,031
这位是卡梅隆 我的伴侣
Uh, this is -- this is Cameron, my partner...

38
00:01:13,112 --> 00:01:14,773
这是我们的女儿莉莉
Oh. And, uh, our daughter, Lily.

39
00:01:16,053 --> 00:01:18,060
小卡 这位是 这位是翠西
Oh, Cam, this is -- this is Tracy.

40
00:01:18,060 --> 00:01:19,500
就是你之前提过的那位翠西啊
Oh. "Tracy" Tracy.

41
00:01:19,573 --> 00:01:21,293
-是的 -久仰大名
- Yes. - Oh, hi.

42
00:01:21,366 --> 00:01:23,127
翠西是我高中时的女朋友
Tracy was my high-school girlfriend.

43
00:01:23,200 --> 00:01:24,420
千真万确哦
Yes. Yes, it's true.

44
00:01:24,420 --> 00:01:26,240
我交过女朋友 事实上还不止一个
I had girlfriends -- quite a few, actually.

45
00:01:26,360 --> 00:01:28,800
我也带过不少女生去鸡舍呢
I, too, took my fair share of ladies to the hen house.

46
00:01:29,540 --> 00:01:29,840
真的就是鸡舍
Literally,

47
00:01:29,840 --> 00:01:30,920
我带她们去养鸡的地方
I did take them to the hen house.

48
00:01:31,040 --> 00:01:31,600
那可是农场里
That's the only place

49
00:01:31,600 --> 00:01:33,120
唯一能有点隐私的地方
you could get some privacy on a farm.

50
00:01:33,220 --> 00:01:33,520
真的吗
Really?

51
00:01:33,520 --> 00:01:35,520
那些 那些女孩叫什么
What were these -- what were these girls' names?

52
00:01:35,520 --> 00:01:37,160
有奈丽·福布什
Oh, well, there was Nellie Forbush...

53
00:01:38,120 --> 00:01:39,000
贝蒂·里佐
Betty Rizzo...

54
00:01:39,680 --> 00:01:40,660
-艾丽莎 -杜利特尔
- Eliza... - Doolittle.

55
00:01:41,220 --> 00:01:42,920
这些都是音乐剧人物的名字
These are characters from musicals.

56
00:01:43,620 --> 00:01:44,380
你太基了
You're so gay,

57
00:01:44,380 --> 00:01:45,880
你都想不出个女生的名字
you can't even think of real girls' names.

58
00:01:45,880 --> 00:01:46,903
金·麦卡非 这可是个真名字
Kim Mcafee -- that's a real one.

59
00:01:46,903 --> 00:01:49,060
这是《再见，伯迪》里面的
"Bye Bye Birdie."

60
00:01:49,060 --> 00:01:49,720
你最近怎么样
What's new?

61
00:01:50,080 --> 00:01:51,400
我去年结婚了
I got married last year.

62
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:52,580
太棒了
Th-that's great.

63
00:01:52,660 --> 00:01:53,840
你打算在城里待多久
How long are you in town for?

64
00:01:53,840 --> 00:01:55,940
就待个两三天 我们现在住我父母家
Just a couple of days. We're staying at my folks'.

65
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:58,040
我太想知道米奇尔高中时是啥样的了
Oh, I want to hear all about Mitchell from high school.

66
00:01:58,120 --> 00:01:58,840
那时他有胡子吗
Did he have a beard?

67
00:01:59,320 --> 00:02:00,720
他现在跟那时一样 没怎么变
Uh, you're looking at her.

68
00:02:01,440 --> 00:02:03,320
当然我那时不知道他喜欢男生
Of course I didn't know it back then.

69
00:02:03,410 --> 00:02:04,950
不过我们应该
But we should -- we should all

70
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:06,760
一起出来聚聚
we should all hang out.

71
00:02:06,840 --> 00:02:08,629
还是算了吧
Uh...no.

72
00:02:08,708 --> 00:02:10,532
保重
W-well, take care.

73
00:02:10,600 --> 00:02:11,020
好的
Okay.

74
00:02:12,180 --> 00:02:12,620
再见
Bye.

75
00:02:12,739 --> 00:02:17,618
瞧她那冷冰冰的表情
Thumpety thump-thump. Look at frosty go!

76
00:02:17,720 --> 00:02:18,480
是有点奇怪
That was weird.

77
00:02:18,568 --> 00:02:21,572
别想哪么多了 都是高中的事了
Well, don't worry about it. It's high school, honey.

78
00:02:21,660 --> 00:02:23,440
-实际上 -怎么了
- Well, actually... - What?

79
00:02:23,506 --> 00:02:27,160
毕业十周年聚会上 我们有点喝多了
At our 10-year reunion, we got a little drunk,

80
00:02:27,160 --> 00:02:29,300
于是开始追忆往事 结果不知不觉就
started reminiscing, one thing led to another...

81
00:02:30,360 --> 00:02:31,400
难道你又变直了
You went back?

82
00:02:32,320 --> 00:02:33,700
我只是想看看我能不能做到
I-I think I just wanted to see if I could.

83
00:02:34,440 --> 00:02:35,420
结果我还真可以
Turns out I could.

84
00:02:36,640 --> 00:02:37,840
这事儿在哪发生的
Where did this happen?!

85
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:38,940
在校医室
Um, in the nurse's office.

86
00:02:38,940 --> 00:02:40,680
我耳边现在还响着纸张的卷缩声
I can still hear the crinkling of the paper.

87
00:02:41,260 --> 00:02:43,720
在那之后我一直没回过她电话
After that, I-I didn't return any of her phone calls,

88
00:02:43,720 --> 00:02:45,980
也没再见过她
and I haven't seen her since.

89
00:02:47,720 --> 00:02:49,440
你这个小坏蛋
You naughty little girl.

90
00:02:49,580 --> 00:02:50,840
没办法 可可利口酒喝多了
Well, you know, that's what happens

91
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:51,760
我就会这样
when you give me Kahlua.

92
00:03:07,180 --> 00:03:07,660
喂
Hello.

93
00:03:08,120 --> 00:03:09,620
杰 猜猜刚才谁打电话来了
Jay, guess who called.

94
00:03:09,900 --> 00:03:11,280
-霍夫曼一家 -谁
- The hoffmans. - Who?

95
00:03:11,720 --> 00:03:12,480
没错
That's right.

96
00:03:12,480 --> 00:03:14,280
就是我们在卡波的酒店酒吧里认识的那家人
The ones from the hotel bar in Cabo.

97
00:03:14,540 --> 00:03:16,800
他们今晚进城过夜 想一跟咱们起吃个晚饭
They're in town for the night. They want to go to dinner.

98
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:18,980
该死 是那个无趣男和那个大嗓门吗
Oh, hell. The boring guy and the loudmouth?

99
00:03:18,980 --> 00:03:21,660
就是 接到他们的电话我超开心
I know. I was so excited that they called.

100
00:03:21,740 --> 00:03:22,480
我不想见他们
I don't want to see them.

101
00:03:22,720 --> 00:03:24,780
就是 他们太好玩了
I know! So much fun!

102
00:03:25,740 --> 00:03:27,160
你正和他们在一起吧
You're with them right now, aren't you?

103
00:03:27,223 --> 00:03:28,940
是啊
Yes! Ha ha.

104
00:03:28,940 --> 00:03:31,120
他们也迫不及待想见你呢
And they can't wait to see you, too!

105
00:03:34,495 --> 00:03:38,196
好了 把笔放下 你必须休息一下
Okay, pencils down. You're taking a break.

106
00:03:38,196 --> 00:03:40,360
不行 我可不能休息
No, I-I can't afford to take a break.

107
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:41,440
桑杰·帕特尔也没休息
Sanjay patel's not taking a break.

108
00:03:41,600 --> 00:03:44,600
显然桑杰的父母不关心他
Well, obviously, Sanjay's parents don't care about him.

109
00:03:44,600 --> 00:03:45,100
或是"她"
Or "her".

110
00:03:45,340 --> 00:03:46,360
桑杰是个什么破名字啊
What is that -- "Sanjay"?

111
00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:47,500
桑杰是全班
Sanjay's the only one in class

112
00:03:47,500 --> 00:03:48,380
唯一可能超过我的人
who might do better than me,

113
00:03:48,380 --> 00:03:49,760
我绝对不允许这件事发生
and I cannot let that happen.

114
00:03:50,060 --> 00:03:51,180
宝贝 听听你说的话
Honey, listen to yourself.

115
00:03:51,440 --> 00:03:52,680
这心态可不健康
It's just not healthy.

116
00:03:52,860 --> 00:03:53,640
都是我的错
This is my fault.

117
00:03:54,340 --> 00:03:55,700
你看到我如此优异
You see me achieve excellence,

118
00:03:55,700 --> 00:03:57,200
所以压力才会很大
and it puts a lot of pressure on you.

119
00:03:57,740 --> 00:03:58,400
那我呢
What about me?

120
00:03:59,160 --> 00:04:00,040
不好意思
Sorry. Yeah.

121
00:04:00,200 --> 00:04:02,040
我的优异让你们两个都有很大压力
It puts a lot of pressure on both of you.

122
00:04:02,620 --> 00:04:03,160
谢谢你 菲尔
Thanks, Phil.

123
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:06,440
-好了 走吧 我们找点乐子去 -不要
- Okay, come on. Let's go have some fun! - No!

124
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:07,060
走吧
Let's go!

125
00:04:07,440 --> 00:04:07,880
没错
Yes!

126
00:04:10,265 --> 00:04:12,372
这感觉不错吧 宝贝儿
Doesn't this feel good, sweetheart?

127
00:04:12,460 --> 00:04:13,640
好玩吧
It's fun, right?

128
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:18,720
说实在的 我觉得你太过担心莉莉了
Honestly, I think you're overly worried about Lily.

129
00:04:18,840 --> 00:04:20,860
又不是说她长大后就会变成贼
It's not like she's gonna grow up to be a thief.

130
00:04:21,540 --> 00:04:22,920
再说 最重要的是
And besides, at the end of the day,

131
00:04:23,020 --> 00:04:24,700
她的行为准则是跟谁学的
who does she learn her behavior from?

132
00:04:25,980 --> 00:04:26,460
我们
Us.

133
00:04:26,460 --> 00:04:28,020
我们是她的楷模
We're her role models.

134
00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:33,880
就像我妈常说的那样
Like mama always said,

135
00:04:34,100 --> 00:04:36,380
我们的孩子就是我们的迷你版本
our children are just miniature versions of us.

136
00:04:36,780 --> 00:04:39,880
-走吧 -小卡
- Come on. - Cam.

137
00:04:43,520 --> 00:04:44,980
来嘛 杰
Oh, come on, Jay.

138
00:04:45,060 --> 00:04:46,200
给姐笑个
Give me one smile.

139
00:04:46,300 --> 00:04:47,640
我知道你很开心的
I know you want to.

140
00:04:48,500 --> 00:04:51,360
来嘛 杰 给姐笑个 我知道你很开心的
Oh, come on, Jay. Give me one smile. I know you want to.

141
00:04:52,520 --> 00:04:53,920
这个好玩吧 杰
Isn't that fun, Jay?

142
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:57,300
咱们聚在一起真是太好了
Oh, this has been so much fun!

143
00:04:57,660 --> 00:04:59,300
听到你这么说 我很惊讶呢
You know, I'm surprised to hear you say that.

144
00:04:59,340 --> 00:05:00,260
你今晚一直都很沉默呢
You've been pretty quiet.

145
00:05:00,700 --> 00:05:02,120
那是因为我是个聆听者
That's because I'm a listener.

146
00:05:02,120 --> 00:05:03,657
我喜欢聆听
I love to listen.

147
00:05:03,720 --> 00:05:04,800
这是我的爱好
It's my hobby.

148
00:05:05,480 --> 00:05:06,460
聆听是你的爱好吗
Listening is your hobby?

149
00:05:06,500 --> 00:05:06,860
当然
Sure.

150
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:09,580
你们一定要过来拜访我们
You guys have got to come out and visit us.

151
00:05:09,580 --> 00:05:11,320
说真的 你们可不能拒绝
Seriously. We're not taking no for an answer.

152
00:05:11,320 --> 00:05:11,700
没错 没错 没错
Yes. Yes, yes.

153
00:05:11,700 --> 00:05:14,020
-我们非常愿意 -好吧 咱慢慢来
- Oh, we would love to! - Okay, let's slow down.

154
00:05:14,620 --> 00:05:15,820
你们是很好的人
You're nice people.

155
00:05:16,060 --> 00:05:17,060
我们也是很好的人
We're nice people.

156
00:05:17,580 --> 00:05:18,540
但是 说实在的
But let's be honest --

157
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:20,080
我们都在尝试着
we've all tried to do that thing

158
00:05:20,080 --> 00:05:21,180
逼自己认为咱们是朋友
where we force a friendship

159
00:05:21,180 --> 00:05:23,100
但实际上咱们并不是
that isn't really there.

160
00:05:23,320 --> 00:05:26,000
所以咱们何不就此结束这一切
So why don't we just call it a day right now

161
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:28,120
相互道再见 握个手
and say goodbye, shake hands,

162
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:29,280
祝愿每个人幸福安康
wish each other well?

163
00:05:30,260 --> 00:05:30,980
我的天啊
Oh, my god.

164
00:05:31,880 --> 00:05:33,000
这太尴尬了
This is so uncomfortable.

165
00:05:33,260 --> 00:05:34,400
不 不 这件事好就好在
No, no, but the beauty of it is

166
00:05:34,400 --> 00:05:35,540
我们以后永远都不会再见面了
we're never gonna see each other again,

167
00:05:35,540 --> 00:05:37,020
所以 也用不着感到尴尬
so there's no reason to be uncomfortable.

168
00:05:37,840 --> 00:05:39,380
他们今晚住咱们家
They're staying with us tonight.

169
00:05:39,560 --> 00:05:41,160
他们的行李还在咱家呢
Their bags are in our house.

170
00:05:41,231 --> 00:05:44,929
那么你说对了
Oh, then you were right.

171
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:45,960
这的确很尴尬
This is uncomfortable.

172
00:05:46,280 --> 00:05:47,080
这的确很尴尬
This is uncomfortable.

173
00:05:52,300 --> 00:05:53,280
好吃吗
Do you like it?

174
00:05:53,540 --> 00:05:55,160
做这道菜的时候需要加一杯水
The recipe called for a cup of water,

175
00:05:55,200 --> 00:05:57,020
但是我用牛奶替代了 这样酱汁更粘稠
but I used milk instead to make the sauce creamier.

176
00:05:58,579 --> 00:05:59,964
小卡 我要跟你说件事
Cam, I need to tell you something.

177
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:00,640
你讨厌这道菜
You hate it.

178
00:06:00,780 --> 00:06:01,540
-卡梅隆 -不
- Cameron. - No.

179
00:06:01,660 --> 00:06:03,140
你是对的 我永远都不该尝试新的东西
You're right. I shouldn't try anything new ever.

180
00:06:03,420 --> 00:06:04,720
别闹了 我要跟你说正事
Stop it. I'm trying to talk to you.

181
00:06:04,720 --> 00:06:05,980
是这样的 今天
Okay, today,

182
00:06:06,040 --> 00:06:07,180
当我们离开百货商场的时候
when we were leaving the mall,

183
00:06:07,820 --> 00:06:09,720
我看到翠西在喷泉旁
I saw Tracy by the fountain --

184
00:06:09,778 --> 00:06:11,475
不要告诉我你又跟她睡了
Please, don't tell me you slept with her again.

185
00:06:12,840 --> 00:06:14,680
有吗 没有吧 对吧
Did you? You didn't. Right?

186
00:06:14,980 --> 00:06:15,540
你在开玩笑
You're joking.

187
00:06:16,160 --> 00:06:16,500
是的
Yeah.

188
00:06:16,500 --> 00:06:17,946
好吧
Okay. Um...

189
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:20,460
我不知道该怎么开口 我都不知道我猜的对不对
I don't know how to say this, or -- or if I'm even right.

190
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:21,260
也许是我猜错了
I'm probably not.

191
00:06:21,260 --> 00:06:25,540
但是 她跟一个大概八岁左右的
But, um, she was with a redheaded boy,

192
00:06:25,540 --> 00:06:28,066
红头发的小男孩在一起
about 8 years old,

193
00:06:28,140 --> 00:06:31,820
自从我们俩那个以后 也差不多过了八年
which is the same number of years since we...

194
00:06:31,820 --> 00:06:32,300
不
No!

195
00:06:32,300 --> 00:06:34,680
而她说 她结婚才一年
And she said she'd only been married a year,

196
00:06:34,680 --> 00:06:36,040
而这正好说明了
and it would explain why

197
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:38,920
她见到我为什么会那么别扭
she was so awkward with me, and --

198
00:06:40,680 --> 00:06:41,080
不
No.

199
00:06:41,080 --> 00:06:42,700
我知道 我知道 这很疯狂
I know. I know. It's crazy,

200
00:06:42,880 --> 00:06:44,700
但是 小卡 我必须搞清楚他是不是我儿子
but, Cam, I need to find out if he's mine.

201
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:46,920
你还好吗
Are you okay?

202
00:06:46,920 --> 00:06:49,600
是的 你不能跟你的伴侣说
Yeah. Yeah, well, you don't just tell your partner

203
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:50,900
你或许跟其他人有了孩子
you may have a baby with someone else

204
00:06:50,978 --> 00:06:52,160
然后还指望他能
and expect him to go back to eating

205
00:06:52,160 --> 00:06:53,880
像什么事都没发生过一样
a delicious and inventive meal

206
00:06:53,880 --> 00:06:54,780
继续吃这顿美味且独创的佳肴
like it's nothing!

207
00:06:54,780 --> 00:06:56,876
我明白 小卡 可就算他真是我儿子
Okay, Cam, but even if he is mine,

208
00:06:56,980 --> 00:06:58,820
咱俩之间也不会有任何改变
it doesn't change anything between us.

209
00:06:59,100 --> 00:07:00,800
米奇尔 你必须得让我消化一下
Mitchell, I need to have my reaction.

210
00:07:10,480 --> 00:07:10,880
杰
Jay!

211
00:07:10,880 --> 00:07:12,700
他们叫了一辆出租车 你现在满意了吗
They order a cab. Are you happy now?

212
00:07:12,700 --> 00:07:14,340
当我听到关车门的声音才会满意
I'll be happy when I hear a trunk close.

213
00:07:15,900 --> 00:07:17,700
妈妈 你要喝杯水吗
Hey, mom. You want a drink of water?

214
00:07:17,778 --> 00:07:19,374
不 小可爱 现在不要
No, pape. Not right now.

215
00:07:19,440 --> 00:07:20,920
你确定吗 你看起来很渴
You sure? You look thirsty.

216
00:07:20,990 --> 00:07:22,420
你今天是怎么了 老叫我喝水
What's with you and the water today?

217
00:07:22,490 --> 00:07:23,660
这是一个滴水杯
It's a dribble cup.

218
00:07:23,720 --> 00:07:25,400
用它喝水肯定会漏
You can't drink from it without spilling.

219
00:07:25,700 --> 00:07:27,560
我觉得这会让我很受欢迎
I think it's going to make me very popular.

220
00:07:27,643 --> 00:07:29,560
小可爱 你为啥要用这些东西
Ay, pape, why do you need these things

221
00:07:29,560 --> 00:07:30,620
来让你受欢迎呢
to make you popular?

222
00:07:30,880 --> 00:07:32,000
先是拐杖
First the walking stick,

223
00:07:32,020 --> 00:07:33,820
-然后又是名片的 -他们走了吗
- then the business cards. - Are they gone yet?

224
00:07:34,300 --> 00:07:36,320
你为何要跟他们说那种话
Why did you talk to them like that?

225
00:07:36,340 --> 00:07:37,580
怎么了 我不过是实话实说罢了
What? I was just being honest.

226
00:07:37,640 --> 00:07:38,680
他们无聊得要死
They're boring as hell!

227
00:07:38,751 --> 00:07:40,143
小声点 他们会听到的
Quiet! They can hear you!

228
00:07:40,215 --> 00:07:41,180
他或许已经听到了
Oh, he probably already heard me.

229
00:07:41,180 --> 00:07:42,260
他的兴趣就是聆听嘛
His hobby is listening.

230
00:07:42,980 --> 00:07:44,940
杰 你不能这样对待别人
Jay, you don't treat people like that.

231
00:07:45,120 --> 00:07:46,180
怎么 难道要我像你一样吗
What? I should do what you do?

232
00:07:46,380 --> 00:07:47,380
假装喜欢那些你并不喜欢的人
Pretend to like someone you don't?

233
00:07:47,720 --> 00:07:48,720
我现在就在假装喜欢你
I'm doing it right now.

234
00:07:49,440 --> 00:07:50,740
这么说吧 歌洛莉亚
Can I tell you something, Gloria?

235
00:07:50,740 --> 00:07:52,680
当你到了一定年纪
When you reach a certain age,

236
00:07:52,740 --> 00:07:55,720
你就会想把你余下的这点宝贵的时间
you want to spend what precious little time you have left

237
00:07:55,720 --> 00:07:57,340
花在那些你真正喜欢的人身上
with people you actually like,

238
00:07:57,340 --> 00:07:59,680
而不是那些想从你这得到什么的混蛋身上
not some bozos who glommed onto you.

239
00:07:59,760 --> 00:08:00,600
深有同感
Tell me about it.

240
00:08:00,700 --> 00:08:02,620
有一个五年级的总粘着我 甩都甩不掉
I've got a clingy fifth grader I can't shake.

241
00:08:02,680 --> 00:08:03,640
瞧见了没 连曼尼都知道
See, even Manny knows.

242
00:08:03,960 --> 00:08:05,760
我支持你 杰 渴了吗
I got your back, Jay. Thirsty?

243
00:08:06,540 --> 00:08:07,360
曼尼 去睡觉
Manny, go to sleep.

244
00:08:07,500 --> 00:08:09,620
我们能不能别再提这事了
Can we just please forget about this now?

245
00:08:09,660 --> 00:08:10,640
最过分的是
And the worst thing

246
00:08:10,704 --> 00:08:12,496
你都不警告我一下 就把我给卖了
is that you sold me out without warning

247
00:08:12,560 --> 00:08:14,120
让我像个傻瓜一样
and made me look like a fool.

248
00:08:14,700 --> 00:08:16,300
夫妇间应该互相帮助
Husband and wife are supposed to help each other,

249
00:08:16,300 --> 00:08:17,720
而不是把对方往火坑里推
not throw each other under the bus!

250
00:08:18,400 --> 00:08:19,960
我就绝不会那样对你
I would never do that to you!

251
00:08:19,960 --> 00:08:21,620
歌洛莉亚 歌洛莉亚 等等
Gloria -- Gloria, wait!

252
00:08:23,500 --> 00:08:25,840
帮我拿一下书好吗 我把它落在楼下了
Could you get my book for me? I left it downstairs.

253
00:08:30,060 --> 00:08:30,900
你来了
There you are.

254
00:08:31,260 --> 00:08:32,320
我们的计程车到了
Our cab is here.

255
00:08:32,780 --> 00:08:33,920
我真的很抱歉
I am so sorry.

256
00:08:34,120 --> 00:08:36,240
不是你的错 那就再见了
Not your fault. Well, goodbye.

257
00:08:37,936 --> 00:08:39,749
等一下 你们忘了拿这个
Ay, wait. You left this.

258
00:08:39,840 --> 00:08:41,200
不 那是送给你的
Oh, no, that's...for you.

259
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:43,460
在卡波你说过自己是
In Cabo, you mentioned you were a fan

260
00:08:43,538 --> 00:08:44,645
加夫列尔·加西亚·马尔克斯的粉丝
of Gabriel García Márquez.

261
00:08:44,700 --> 00:08:46,360
所以我们找到他
So, we tracked him down

262
00:08:46,360 --> 00:08:47,320
让他在《百年孤独》一书上
and got him to sign a copy

263
00:08:47,320 --> 00:08:49,277
为你签名
of "One Hundred Years of Solitude" for you.

264
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:51,200
这礼物太珍贵了
That's amazing.

265
00:08:51,940 --> 00:08:52,580
我们走了
Well...

266
00:08:53,820 --> 00:08:55,080
不 不 别走
No, no. Don't go.

267
00:08:55,520 --> 00:08:57,600
我真的想留你们在这过夜
I really want you to spend the night here.

268
00:08:57,900 --> 00:08:58,800
杰显然不这么想
Jay clearly doesn't.

269
00:08:59,040 --> 00:09:00,440
杰不知道自己想要什么
Jay doesn't know what he wants.

270
00:09:01,360 --> 00:09:03,640
虽然我不愿跟别人提起这事 不过
I don't like to tell this to people, but, uh...

271
00:09:03,721 --> 00:09:07,232
杰的脑子已经 不太好使了
Jay's mind is...going away.

272
00:09:07,313 --> 00:09:08,999
-天哪 -不会吧
- Oh, my god. - No.

273
00:09:09,080 --> 00:09:12,880
他年事已高 好几个夜晚我甚至感觉
He's so old, some nights it's like...

274
00:09:12,880 --> 00:09:14,440
他的神智都不怎么清楚了
he's not even here.

275
00:09:16,080 --> 00:09:17,380
歌洛莉亚 亲爱的
Gloria, honey.

276
00:09:18,320 --> 00:09:20,780
就这么定了 我们哪都不去了
That's it. We're not going anywhere.

277
00:09:20,860 --> 00:09:22,260
过来
Come on.

278
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:31,420
你昨晚没上床睡觉
You never came to bed.

279
00:09:31,940 --> 00:09:33,220
我在书房睡着了
I fell asleep in the den.

280
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:35,780
小卡 我们得谈谈
Cam, we need to talk about --

281
00:09:35,980 --> 00:09:36,940
米奇尔 等等
Mitchell, wait.

282
00:09:38,140 --> 00:09:38,460
听着
Listen.

283
00:09:38,560 --> 00:09:41,460
我彻夜未眠 思前想后
I was up all night, thinking about it.

284
00:09:41,460 --> 00:09:42,400
得出的结论是
And here's the thing.

285
00:09:42,479 --> 00:09:44,353
如果十年前你告诉我
If you would have told me 10 years ago

286
00:09:44,420 --> 00:09:45,720
有朝一日我会和某人共同生活
that I would be living with someone

287
00:09:45,720 --> 00:09:47,660
并一起养育一个漂亮的小女孩
and raising a beautiful baby girl,

288
00:09:47,680 --> 00:09:49,260
我会说你疯了
I would have said you were crazy.

289
00:09:50,020 --> 00:09:51,600
但现在这一切都成了事实
But here we are.

290
00:09:51,740 --> 00:09:53,720
你和莉莉是我生命中
And you and Lily are the best things

291
00:09:53,720 --> 00:09:55,140
最美好的东西
that have ever happened to me.

292
00:09:55,620 --> 00:09:57,200
所以如果你说还有一个孩子
So if you're telling me there's another kid,

293
00:09:58,180 --> 00:09:59,580
那只能是件好事了 对吧
how can that be anything but good?

294
00:09:59,655 --> 00:10:02,372
小卡 我太 我太
Oh, Cam, that's -- that means so --

295
00:10:02,460 --> 00:10:03,260
不 没事的
No, it's okay.

296
00:10:03,320 --> 00:10:04,700
不 我必须释放一下情感
No, I need to have my reaction.

297
00:10:05,892 --> 00:10:07,153
我们会没事的
We're gonna be okay.

298
00:10:08,980 --> 00:10:09,980
那我们现在该怎么办
So what do we do now?

299
00:10:10,061 --> 00:10:11,638
不知道 我想我应该
I don't know. I guess I'm gonna have to --

300
00:10:11,707 --> 00:10:12,939
我应该打个电话给翠西
I'm gonna have to call Tracy

301
00:10:13,020 --> 00:10:14,480
跟她说我们得谈谈
and tell her that we need to talk.

302
00:10:16,280 --> 00:10:16,680
好吧
Okay.

303
00:10:16,680 --> 00:10:18,140
-你紧张吗 -我快吓死了
- Are you nervous? - I'm terrified.

304
00:10:18,580 --> 00:10:21,100
我是说 这孩子会怎么想我
Yes. I mean, what's this kid gonna think of me?

305
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:23,420
他人生最初的八年我都不在身边
I've been absent for the first eight years of his life.

306
00:10:23,420 --> 00:10:25,218
该如何弥补这一段时间
I mean, how do you make up for time like that when --

307
00:10:25,288 --> 00:10:26,338
好 你先冷静下来
Okay, slow down.

308
00:10:26,420 --> 00:10:27,120
你想太多了
You're spinning out.

309
00:10:27,280 --> 00:10:28,500
也许这一切都只是咱俩在瞎想
It's probably just a false alarm.

310
00:10:28,780 --> 00:10:29,420
你说得对
No, you're right.

311
00:10:29,760 --> 00:10:31,980
可能跟我上次以为自己要秃了那次一样
This could be my "going bald" scare all over again.

312
00:10:32,260 --> 00:10:34,220
是啊 咱都知道那事的最终结果
Yeah. And we know how that turned out.

313
00:10:39,380 --> 00:10:40,100
亲爱的
Honey.

314
00:10:41,020 --> 00:10:43,780
如果世上最伟大的科学家们联手促成
What would happen if the greatest scientists on earth

315
00:10:43,780 --> 00:10:47,060
两大最凶猛食肉动物的交配会怎么样
got together to mate nature's two most violent predators?

316
00:10:48,965 --> 00:10:52,732
你是在说"蓝环章鱼"3D版吗
Are we talking about "Croctopus" in 3D?

317
00:10:52,807 --> 00:10:53,840
两张十美元
At 2 10.

318
00:10:53,840 --> 00:10:54,460
速度出手
Book it!

319
00:10:55,400 --> 00:10:58,500
克莱尔和我热衷于淘便宜电影票
Claire and I share a true love of cheesy cinema.

320
00:10:58,580 --> 00:11:00,240
我们喜欢的影片类型有
Um, our favorite categories

321
00:11:00,320 --> 00:11:03,060
基因处理后失控的生物
include genetically engineered animals gone wrong...

322
00:11:03,060 --> 00:11:04,840
交换肉身的老者与少年
Old and young people switching bodies.

323
00:11:04,945 --> 00:11:07,595
艰苦养育孩子的人们
Uh, tough guys taking care of babies.

324
00:11:07,700 --> 00:11:09,020
出过3部以上续集的任何一部电影
Any sequel three and higher.

325
00:11:09,180 --> 00:11:09,840
没错
Oh, yeah.

326
00:11:09,900 --> 00:11:11,480
通常新片的入手价在一张五美元左右
Usually get a new cast around five --

327
00:11:11,580 --> 00:11:12,840
这才是亮点
That's where the magic really happens.

328
00:11:16,060 --> 00:11:17,520
亲爱的 考试成绩怎么样
Hey, honey, how'd your test go?

329
00:11:17,720 --> 00:11:18,840
全班第二
Second highest in the class.

330
00:11:19,300 --> 00:11:19,980
不错啊
Well, that's great.

331
00:11:20,240 --> 00:11:22,480
桑杰·帕特尔比我高十二分
Sanjay Patel edged me out by 12 points.

332
00:11:22,580 --> 00:11:24,820
-亲爱的 谁在乎那丫头考几分 -是个小子
- Oh, honey, who cares what she did? - It's a he!

333
00:11:25,120 --> 00:11:27,260
桑杰是个很普通的印度男孩名
Sanjay is a very common Indian boy's name.

334
00:11:27,320 --> 00:11:28,980
叫这名字的有上百万人呢
There are like millions of them.

335
00:11:29,180 --> 00:11:30,140
宝贝 你还是考得很好
Sweetheart, it's still a great score.

336
00:11:30,180 --> 00:11:31,300
你对自己别太苛刻了
I hope you're not beating yourself up.

337
00:11:31,380 --> 00:11:32,780
-我没有 -那才是我们的好孩子
- I'm not. - That's our girl.

338
00:11:33,260 --> 00:11:35,000
桑杰的爸爸是外科医生 妈妈是教授
Sanjay's dad's a surgeon. His mom's a professor.

339
00:11:35,120 --> 00:11:36,180
这我可没法比
I can't compete with that.

340
00:11:36,300 --> 00:11:37,680
我只能根据自家情况
I'll just have to do the best I can

341
00:11:37,680 --> 00:11:38,400
竭尽全力
with what I was given.

342
00:11:38,680 --> 00:11:39,620
好孩子
Good for you!

343
00:11:39,820 --> 00:11:40,700
亲爱的 我们为你骄傲
We're proud of you, honey.

344
00:11:41,220 --> 00:11:42,360
她真是个好孩子
She's such a good kid.

345
00:11:42,540 --> 00:11:43,560
是啊
Yeah, she is.

346
00:11:44,780 --> 00:11:46,440
她是不是说只能
Did she just say she was gonna do the best

347
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:47,460
根据自家情况竭尽全力
with what she was given?

348
00:11:47,660 --> 00:11:49,420
不知道啊 我还在想有那么多人叫桑杰
I don't know. I was still thinking about all the Sanjays.

349
00:11:49,420 --> 00:11:52,420
我却一个也不认识 但我认识三个叫米尔顿的
I don't know any, but I know three Miltons.

350
00:11:52,420 --> 00:11:53,760
她是在嫌我们笨
She's saying we're stupid!

351
00:11:55,380 --> 00:11:56,480
那她就错了
Well, she's...wrong.

352
00:11:56,780 --> 00:11:57,420
真的吗
Is she?

353
00:11:57,680 --> 00:11:58,980
亲爱的 你看咱俩过了多久
Honey, look at how long it just took us

354
00:11:58,980 --> 00:12:00,780
才明白她是在损我们
to figure out that she's insulting us.

355
00:12:01,260 --> 00:12:03,160
我们给孩子拖后腿了吗
Are we holding our kids back?

356
00:12:03,720 --> 00:12:05,420
才没呢 咱俩都挺聪明的
No. We're both bright people.

357
00:12:06,140 --> 00:12:07,860
咱俩都是大学毕业 爱看书
We're college graduates. We read.

358
00:12:08,848 --> 00:12:09,650
我觉得我可以肯定地说
I'd go so far as to say

359
00:12:09,660 --> 00:12:11,660
咱俩的智慧和阅历就跟
we're as intellectual and sophisticated as --

360
00:12:11,660 --> 00:12:14,540
太棒了 “蓝环章鱼”的票到手了
Sweet! "Croctopus" tickets confirmed!

361
00:12:20,600 --> 00:12:22,160
我只是觉得应该我们应该提议带曼尼去玩玩
Oh, I just think that we should offer to take Manny.

362
00:12:22,440 --> 00:12:23,800
也许一起过个周末之类的
Maybe for a weekend. Something.

363
00:12:24,220 --> 00:12:24,760
大家好啊
Hey, guys.

364
00:12:25,080 --> 00:12:26,780
-曼尼好啊 -你好啊曼尼
- Oh, hey, Manny. - Hey, Manny.

365
00:12:29,180 --> 00:12:30,100
你要去哪
Where are you going?

366
00:12:30,100 --> 00:12:31,220
去上高尔夫球课
Got a golf lesson.

367
00:12:31,700 --> 00:12:32,460
我的挥击太烂了
My swing's a mess.

368
00:12:32,700 --> 00:12:33,440
曼尼和我一起去
Manny's coming with me.

369
00:12:33,500 --> 00:12:34,880
不行 你现在不能下楼
No, you can't go downstairs now.

370
00:12:34,880 --> 00:12:36,199
你会撞见霍夫曼夫妇的
You'll run into the Hoffmans.

371
00:12:36,260 --> 00:12:37,340
其实 我也想跟他们谈谈
Actually, I want to talk to them,

372
00:12:37,340 --> 00:12:38,220
因为我一直在想
because I've been thinking about

373
00:12:38,220 --> 00:12:39,140
你昨晚说的话
what you said last night,

374
00:12:39,140 --> 00:12:41,480
我很抱歉让你难堪了
and I'm sorry if I embarrassed you.

375
00:12:41,520 --> 00:12:42,000
你是对的
You're right.

376
00:12:42,240 --> 00:12:43,520
你永远不会对我做那样的事
You never would have done that to me.

377
00:12:43,660 --> 00:12:45,100
-我原谅你了 -所以我要去跟他们道个别
- I forgive you! - So I'll say goodbye.

378
00:12:45,140 --> 00:12:46,040
杰 不要去
No, Jay.

379
00:12:46,200 --> 00:12:47,180
别去
Don't do that.

380
00:12:47,420 --> 00:12:49,020
一开始他们以为你喜欢他们
First they think you like them.

381
00:12:49,100 --> 00:12:50,820
然后又觉得你不喜欢他们
Then they think you don't like them.

382
00:12:50,840 --> 00:12:51,760
别把他们搞糊涂了
Don't confuse them.

383
00:12:51,780 --> 00:12:53,200
我想为你做这件事
I want to do this for you.

384
00:12:54,780 --> 00:12:55,560
杰 等一下
Jay, wait!

385
00:12:55,660 --> 00:12:56,220
没关系的
It's okay.

386
00:12:56,220 --> 00:12:58,817
杰 等一下
Ay, Jay, wait!

387
00:12:59,354 --> 00:13:02,280
那么 你是 你是怎么做到的呢
So, hey, how -- how are you handling things,

388
00:13:02,280 --> 00:13:03,620
我是说 和杰相处
you know, with Jay?

389
00:13:03,840 --> 00:13:04,520
什么意思
What do you mean?

390
00:13:05,420 --> 00:13:06,920
亲爱的 你妈妈跟我们说了
Honey, your mom told us

391
00:13:06,920 --> 00:13:08,040
杰的情况 我是说
that Jay's, you know,

392
00:13:08,120 --> 00:13:09,420
他状态有点不太好
a little off his game.

393
00:13:09,560 --> 00:13:11,200
哪止一点呀 简直不能看
A little? It's hard to watch.

394
00:13:11,880 --> 00:13:14,500
那他一定很沮丧
It must be so frustrating for him.

395
00:13:14,600 --> 00:13:16,520
他的确经常骂人
Well, he does swear a lot.

396
00:13:16,520 --> 00:13:19,720
最糟糕的是当他跑进树林的时候
You know, the worst is when he goes off into the woods.

397
00:13:19,720 --> 00:13:21,220
还有 当他开车的时候
Oh, and when he drives --

398
00:13:21,540 --> 00:13:22,900
我的天呐 真得小心
Oh, my god. Look out.

399
00:13:22,900 --> 00:13:24,780
我很惊讶他到现在还没撞死过人
I'm surprised he hasn't killed anybody yet!

400
00:13:27,400 --> 00:13:29,620
太好了 你们还在
I'm so glad you guys are still here.

401
00:13:29,980 --> 00:13:32,140
我只是想说
I just want to say...

402
00:13:32,140 --> 00:13:33,460
昨晚很抱歉
sorry for last night.

403
00:13:33,620 --> 00:13:34,380
没关系的
It's okay.

404
00:13:34,520 --> 00:13:35,580
我们理解
We understand.

405
00:13:35,580 --> 00:13:38,455
你看 问题解决了吧
Ay, you see? Problem is solved.

406
00:13:38,540 --> 00:13:39,680
走吧 你要迟到了
Now go. You're going to be late.

407
00:13:39,760 --> 00:13:40,820
你们都没有错
There's nothing wrong with you guys.

408
00:13:40,820 --> 00:13:41,740
错的是我
You know, it's -- it's me.

409
00:13:41,740 --> 00:13:42,340
我们知道
Oh, we know.

410
00:13:42,340 --> 00:13:45,978
斯蒂芬的父亲也有过同样的经历 我们能了解
We went through the same thing with Steph's father.

411
00:13:45,978 --> 00:13:46,960
现在我有点懵了
Now I'm confused.

412
00:13:46,960 --> 00:13:47,680
我是斯蒂芬
I'm Steph.

413
00:13:48,360 --> 00:13:50,600
杰 拿着 我给你倒了一杯橙汁
Uh, here, Jay. I poured you a glass of orange juice.

414
00:13:50,620 --> 00:13:51,180
谢谢你 孩子
Thanks, kid.

415
00:13:56,040 --> 00:13:58,200
怎么回事 我到底是怎么了
What the hell? What's wrong with me?!

416
00:13:58,400 --> 00:13:59,260
这总是很好玩
It's always funny.

417
00:13:59,620 --> 00:14:00,520
杰 去换衣服吧
Jay, go change.

418
00:14:00,620 --> 00:14:01,780
我一会就上来
I'll be there in one second.

419
00:14:01,920 --> 00:14:03,140
也许我们也该出发了
Maybe we should get going.

420
00:14:03,240 --> 00:14:04,780
那至少让我载你们去机场吧
Well, at least let me drive you to the airport.

421
00:14:04,780 --> 00:14:06,100
-不不不不不 -不不不不不
- No, no. No, no, no. - Oh, no, no, no.

422
00:14:06,100 --> 00:14:06,920
我们叫出租车就好
We'll call a cab.

423
00:14:07,920 --> 00:14:09,220
亲爱的 你要吃爆米花什么的吗
Honey, do you want popcorn or anything?

424
00:14:09,360 --> 00:14:10,360
不用 我不想吃
No, I'm good...

425
00:14:10,360 --> 00:14:12,821
再说我自己带了不少吃的呢
'n' plenty.

426
00:14:12,900 --> 00:14:14,840
水也不用买
So hold your water

427
00:14:14,913 --> 00:14:18,575
而且我还在袖子里藏了些特趣巧克力
'cause I've got some "Twix" up my sleeve.

428
00:14:18,660 --> 00:14:19,780
也许你很厉害
You may be cool,

429
00:14:19,780 --> 00:14:22,944
但是我包里有饮料
but I'm...wine cooler.

430
00:14:23,020 --> 00:14:24,020
咱俩真是绝配
I love us.

431
00:14:25,800 --> 00:14:27,000
谢谢
Thank you.

432
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:28,346
你好啊 邓菲
Well, hello, Dunphy!

433
00:14:29,808 --> 00:14:31,360
-那是谁 -是帕特尔夫妇
- Who is that? - It's the Patels,

434
00:14:31,360 --> 00:14:32,140
桑杰的父母
Sanjay's parents.

435
00:14:32,210 --> 00:14:32,340
最近好吧
Hey. Hey, how are you?

436
00:14:32,340 --> 00:14:35,080
我听说桑杰今天考得相当好
I heard Sanjay did so well on his test today.

437
00:14:35,153 --> 00:14:36,722
是的 我们都引以为傲
Oh, yes, we're very proud of him.

438
00:14:36,796 --> 00:14:38,501
确实
Indeed.

439
00:14:38,574 --> 00:14:41,649
你们是来看《两天的生活》的吗
Are you here to see "Deux jour de la vie"?

440
00:14:41,712 --> 00:14:43,877
我们可不是来看《蓝环章鱼》的
Well, we're not here to see "Croctopus"!

441
00:14:46,660 --> 00:14:48,600
如果你听见韦什的抱怨请不要见怪
Forgive Vish if you hear him groan.

442
00:14:48,920 --> 00:14:51,180
他一看见译错的字幕就来气
He gets annoyed if the subtitles are mistranslated.

443
00:14:51,180 --> 00:14:54,409
看来咱俩一样呀
Well, that makes "Deux" of us.

444
00:14:54,840 --> 00:14:57,160
那一会儿 电影院里见了
I guess we'll...see you in there.

445
00:14:57,529 --> 00:14:58,544
-没问题 -当然
- All right. - You bet.

446
00:14:58,620 --> 00:14:59,600
待会见了
See you in there!

447
00:15:03,820 --> 00:15:05,100
菲尔 你去哪啊
Phil, where are you going?!

448
00:15:07,080 --> 00:15:07,560
看"蓝环章鱼"啊
"Croctopus."

449
00:15:09,420 --> 00:15:10,460
亲爱的 亲爱的
Honey. Honey!

450
00:15:10,460 --> 00:15:12,120
我觉得我们应该去看这部电影
I think we should go see this movie.

451
00:15:12,280 --> 00:15:14,000
我为什么非得看一部法国电影呢
Why do I have to watch a French movie?

452
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:15,320
我又没做错事
I didn't do anything wrong.

453
00:15:15,680 --> 00:15:17,560
也许艾丽克斯说的对
Well, maybe Alex has a point.

454
00:15:17,600 --> 00:15:18,840
要是咱俩一点求知欲都没有的话
How can we encourage our kids

455
00:15:18,840 --> 00:15:20,020
又怎么能激发
to have intellectual curiosity

456
00:15:20,116 --> 00:15:21,384
孩子的求知欲呢
when we don't have any?

457
00:15:21,480 --> 00:15:22,460
我不知道
I don't know.

458
00:15:23,040 --> 00:15:24,540
反正只是占咱俩两小时而已
It's two hours of our life.

459
00:15:27,060 --> 00:15:27,540
好吧
Fine.

460
00:15:28,560 --> 00:15:29,180
为了我们的孩子
For our kids.

461
00:15:30,420 --> 00:15:31,840
有时我真讨厌咱孩子
Sometimes I hate the kids.

462
00:15:31,909 --> 00:15:34,082
我知道
I know.

463
00:15:38,960 --> 00:15:40,280
我一点也看不懂
I'm so confused.

464
00:15:40,640 --> 00:15:41,260
我看懂了
I'm not.

465
00:15:41,660 --> 00:15:42,440
我喜欢这电影
I love this.

466
00:15:43,260 --> 00:15:44,180
才不是呢
You do not.

467
00:15:44,660 --> 00:15:46,300
那你说一个你喜欢的情节
Name one thing you've liked about this.

468
00:15:47,740 --> 00:15:49,920
我喜欢有个老人在海滩上的那一幕
I liked the scene with the old man on the beach.

469
00:15:50,100 --> 00:15:51,660
那是另一部电影的预告片
That was a trailer for a different movie.

470
00:15:51,660 --> 00:15:53,320
也就是说那个老头不会再出现了吗
So he's not coming back?

471
00:15:53,420 --> 00:15:54,420
没错 不会出现了
No, he's not coming back,

472
00:15:54,420 --> 00:15:55,400
我也不会再出现了
and I'm not coming back, either!

473
00:15:56,260 --> 00:15:58,700
我还在试着享受这部电影呢
Some of us are trying to enjoy this film.

474
00:16:01,560 --> 00:16:03,580
当克莱尔在看一部
While Claire watched one of the most

475
00:16:03,580 --> 00:16:05,540
受到年度最佳好评的电影时
highly acclaimed films of the year,

476
00:16:08,360 --> 00:16:10,220
毫无教育意义可言的电影
with absolutely no redeeming value.

477
00:16:11,280 --> 00:16:12,620
但是超好看
And it was awesome.

478
00:16:32,860 --> 00:16:33,830
我的天呐
Oh, my god.

479
00:16:34,259 --> 00:16:36,624
感觉就像墨汁真的溅到我身上了一样
It feels like I have ink on me!

480
00:16:42,022 --> 00:16:43,319
亲爱的
Sweetheart...

481
00:16:44,945 --> 00:16:46,142
怎么了
What?

482
00:16:46,212 --> 00:16:47,140
-我的天呐 -亲爱的
- Oh, my god. - Honey...

483
00:16:47,140 --> 00:16:48,620
我睡着了 错过了结局
I fell asleep. I missed it.

484
00:16:48,860 --> 00:16:49,600
好了 我们回家吧
Yeah, let's go home.

485
00:16:50,920 --> 00:16:53,780
我真不敢相信我睡着了 而你又走了
I can't believe I fell asleep and you left.

486
00:16:54,380 --> 00:16:56,000
艾丽克斯说的对 咱俩就是白痴
Alex is right -- we're idiots.

487
00:16:56,600 --> 00:16:57,700
克莱尔 别这样
Claire, stop it.

488
00:17:00,480 --> 00:17:00,920
听着
Look...

489
00:17:00,920 --> 00:17:02,940
我们的孩子是全班第二名
our kid got the second-best grade in the class.

490
00:17:03,940 --> 00:17:05,480
傻瓜父母才养不出这么优秀的孩子
Dumb parents don't make kids that smart.

491
00:17:06,660 --> 00:17:08,400
她遗传了我们俩最好的基因
She got the best of both of us.

492
00:17:09,880 --> 00:17:11,260
想象一下
Kind of like if you combined

493
00:17:11,260 --> 00:17:12,780
如果你创造了一种生物
the jaw strength of a crocodile

494
00:17:12,780 --> 00:17:15,320
既有鳄鱼的嘴巴 还能像章鱼一样喷墨
and the ink-spraying capabilities of an octopus.

495
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:17,760
那一定是无法阻止的怪兽
You'd end up with something unstoppable.

496
00:17:19,600 --> 00:17:21,960
可最后他们还是把他给灭了 不是吗
But they did stop him in the end, didn't they?

497
00:17:22,033 --> 00:17:23,499
应该是"她" 她产了很多蛋
"Her". And she laid eggs.

498
00:17:23,572 --> 00:17:25,833
-蓝环母章鱼 -没错
- Croctopi. - Yeah.

499
00:17:29,800 --> 00:17:32,040
快看 天才在那干吗呢
Check out Einstein over there.

500
00:17:34,100 --> 00:17:35,560
实在太可悲了
Well, that's just sad.

501
00:17:39,291 --> 00:17:40,866
你好啊 韦什
Hey, Vish.

502
00:17:40,940 --> 00:17:42,920
这样就行了
You just do this.

503
00:17:45,580 --> 00:17:46,560
谢谢
Thank you.

504
00:17:46,740 --> 00:17:48,300
你们喜欢这部电影吗
So, did you enjoy the film?

505
00:17:48,300 --> 00:17:50,520
一点也不喜欢
Not in the least.

506
00:17:50,760 --> 00:17:54,000
我觉得效果太二维了
I actually found it quite two-dimensional.

507
00:17:56,340 --> 00:17:58,160
很高兴见到你
Well, lovely to see you.

508
00:17:58,280 --> 00:17:59,080
也很高兴见到你们
Good to see you, too.

509
00:17:59,480 --> 00:18:01,000
好了 先告辞了
All right. Bye.

510
00:18:01,065 --> 00:18:02,175
再见
Bye.

511
00:18:02,240 --> 00:18:03,360
请您先行 医生大人
After you, doctor.

512
00:18:03,840 --> 00:18:05,080
请您先行 教授大人
After you, professor.

513
00:18:18,640 --> 00:18:19,540
米奇尔 卡梅隆
Mitchell, Cameron.

514
00:18:19,680 --> 00:18:20,140
进来吧
Come on in.

515
00:18:22,692 --> 00:18:24,968
我们 我们得谈谈
Um, so...w-we need to talk.

516
00:18:25,660 --> 00:18:26,440
谈什么
About what?

517
00:18:27,080 --> 00:18:28,340
介意我们坐下聊吗
Do you mind if we sit down?

518
00:18:28,460 --> 00:18:28,720
请坐
Please.

519
00:18:29,993 --> 00:18:33,980
翠西 有件事我不吐不快
Um, Tracy, I...I have something to say,

520
00:18:33,980 --> 00:18:34,980
我怕我要是不一次说完
and I'm afraid that if I just don't

521
00:18:34,980 --> 00:18:37,160
就再也说不出口了
say it all at once, I'm never gonna say it.

522
00:18:37,190 --> 00:18:37,745
所以
So...

523
00:18:37,780 --> 00:18:39,520
这让我想起了舞会那晚
This takes me back to prom night.

524
00:18:39,579 --> 00:18:42,042
再次声明 那晚实在抱歉
Again...sorry about that.

525
00:18:42,102 --> 00:18:44,081
总而言之
Anyway, uh,

526
00:18:44,140 --> 00:18:48,180
咱俩昨天在商场碰见之后
I saw you yesterday across the mall after we spoke

527
00:18:48,180 --> 00:18:52,060
我注意到 你是和另一人一同来的
and couldn't help but notice that you weren't alone.

528
00:18:52,129 --> 00:18:54,080
你当时和
Uh, you were with...

529
00:18:54,160 --> 00:18:55,800
我真不知道该怎么启齿
I don't even know how to put this.

530
00:18:56,200 --> 00:18:57,940
他叫波比
His name...is Bobby.

531
00:18:58,940 --> 00:18:59,320
波比
Bobby.

532
00:19:01,080 --> 00:19:02,200
真是个好名字
Such a lovely name.

533
00:19:02,760 --> 00:19:03,240
翠西
Tracy...

534
00:19:03,336 --> 00:19:05,524
他是不是
I-is he...

535
00:19:05,620 --> 00:19:06,600
没错 米奇尔
Yes, Mitchell.

536
00:19:06,700 --> 00:19:07,320
他是
He is.

537
00:19:07,520 --> 00:19:09,000
天呐 好吧
Oh, my god. Oh -- okay.

538
00:19:10,480 --> 00:19:11,980
你怎么不告诉我
Why didn't you tell me?

539
00:19:12,080 --> 00:19:14,320
米奇尔 你和我已经没有任何瓜葛了
Mitchell, you and I don't have a relationship anymore.

540
00:19:14,320 --> 00:19:17,120
我在咱俩那次小小的
I called you after our little...

541
00:19:17,120 --> 00:19:18,600
护士室之旅之后试过给你打电话
visit to the nurse's room.

542
00:19:19,720 --> 00:19:21,360
可你却一个电话都没回给我
You never returned any of my calls.

543
00:19:21,434 --> 00:19:23,147
我当时吓坏了 翠西 我
I-I was freaked out, Tracy, and I --

544
00:19:23,221 --> 00:19:25,986
让我们抛弃过去
Hey, let's not rehash the past...

545
00:19:26,060 --> 00:19:28,020
关注未来
...but rather, focus on the future.

546
00:19:28,086 --> 00:19:29,752
对 对 没错 小卡和我
Yes, yes. Yes, Cam and I, um,

547
00:19:30,020 --> 00:19:33,300
想知道你是否愿意让我们
want to know if you're open...to us...

548
00:19:33,300 --> 00:19:34,940
让我们和波比认识下
getting to know Bobby.

549
00:19:36,040 --> 00:19:37,800
我认为这不是个好主意
I don't think that's a very good idea.

550
00:19:38,140 --> 00:19:39,060
好吧 我懂
Okay, I understand.

551
00:19:39,140 --> 00:19:40,500
起初肯定会有点尴尬
No, it might be a little awkward at first,

552
00:19:40,500 --> 00:19:41,860
可时间能改变一切
but I think after some time...

553
00:19:41,860 --> 00:19:43,860
我们还给他买了礼物
We brought him a present.

554
00:19:45,900 --> 00:19:46,780
给波比的吗
For Bobby?

555
00:19:47,820 --> 00:19:49,180
求求你 我们只是
Please, we just --

556
00:19:49,180 --> 00:19:50,320
我们真的很想见见他
we really just want to meet him.

